From a8be784884cdbf568a2e9637e70f27f6130817e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Junxiao Chang <junxiao.chang@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 10:12:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] vfio/i915: fix double free issue in i915 vfio driver

A double free issue is reported by scan tool. data->buf is free in
__i915_vfio_consume and then in i915_vfio_resume_data_free.

Signed-off-by: Junxiao Chang <junxiao.chang@intel.com>
---
 drivers/vfio/pci/i915/data.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/vfio/pci/i915/data.c b/drivers/vfio/pci/i915/data.c
index 13212c1eaf17..1baa8b60face 100644
--- a/drivers/vfio/pci/i915/data.c
+++ b/drivers/vfio/pci/i915/data.c
@@ -158,6 +158,7 @@ static int __i915_vfio_consume(struct i915_vfio_pci_migration_file *migf, unsign
 
 out_free:
 	kvfree(data->buf);
+	data->buf = NULL;
 
 	return ret;
 }
-- 
2.34.1

